  "notes": "One intact generated Sparky blowing pose. Character, mouthpiece, grip, clothes and feet are byte-identical throughout. Only the paper tube beyond the glove changes length; its curled tip retains its original size. A cosine extension/retraction cycle is rendered at 30 fps, then exact duplicate cells are deduplicated for export. No audio is bundled. The character model is scaled once and normalized to the library reference before publishing. Scale v6: one fixed whole-character transform per clip, matched to the standing-idle median opaque head silhouette area. It includes eyes/mouth, so blinking does not change the scale estimate. No frame-specific scaling, head/body cuts, or pose-height normalization. Grounded contacts remain y592; flight clearance is transformed about the shared root. Pose projection, breathing and original drawing proportions remain intact.",
  "source": "animation/sparky/improved/28-blowing-whistle/optimized-v1/spritesheet.png"
